  {
   "id": "a-game-about-digging-a-hole-325554@post-2025-02-12",
   "gameId": "a-game-about-digging-a-hole-325554",
   "displayName": "Unbelievable Launch & First Updates!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-12T10:31:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Wow, we can hardly believe what’s happening!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A Game About Digging a Hole launched on Friday, and today, just a few days later, it has made it into the Top 30 on the Steam Charts! On Twitch, up to 60,000 viewers were watching simultaneously at its peak, and we are absolutely blown away.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A huge THANK YOU to all of you! Your support and feedback mean everything to us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve been listening, and in the meantime, we’ve already made a few improvements:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FOV slider – You can now adjust the field of view",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Motion blur toggle – Turn it off if you prefer a clearer image",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian & Italian localization fixes – These are currently available in the test branch. To try them out, go to Settings > Betas and select the testing branch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for being part of this wild ride! 🚀⛏️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table noborder=1]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
